sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Pengguna
  participant U as ULTRON
  participant A as hub-api (127.0.0.1)
  participant C as hub-core
  participant D as SQLite
  participant H as Jendela Hub
  P->>U: "tambahkan tugas belajar subnetting besok"
  U->>U: GUARD memeriksa perintah
  U->>A: POST /v1/tasks + token ULTRON
  A->>A: periksa asal lokal, Host, token, cakupan, batas laju
  A->>C: buat tugas (pelaku: ULTRON)
  C->>D: simpan tugas dan Jejak
  C-->>H: kabar perubahan
  H-->>P: tugas tampil dengan tanda ULTRON
  A-->>U: 201 Created
  U-->>P: konfirmasi lewat suara
